<title>USA: Bear Stearns &amp; Co. wins $200 mln NYC GO bonds.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns &amp; Co. wins $200 mln NYC GO bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co. said it won $200 million of New York City general obligation bonds, fiscal 1997 Series M, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.73 percent.</p>
</text>
